      "subject": "feat: Add comprehensive observability stack with Grafana, Loki, Mimir, and Tempo- Add MinIO as S3-compatible storage backend for observability data- Deploy Mimir for long-term metrics storage with remote write from Prometheus- Deploy Loki for centralized log aggregation with multi-tenant support- Deploy Tempo for distributed tracing with OTLP ingestion- Add Grafana Alloy as unified observability collector (logs + traces)- Configure kube-prometheus-stack with Grafana, Prometheus, and Alertmanager- Add custom Grafana dashboards for Kubernetes, MinIO, Loki ops, and service RED metrics- Set up proper multi-tenancy with X-Scope-OrgID headers for tenant isolation- Configure SOPS-encrypted secrets for S3 credentials across all components- Add Grafana ingress with TLS termination via cert-manager- Enable ServiceMonitors for metrics collection from all observability components- Configure MicroK8s-specific volume mounts for container log collection- Add Helm repositories for Grafana, Prometheus Community, and Bitnami charts- Resume apps Kustomization to enable automatic deploymentThis provides a complete observability solution with metrics, logs, and tracesintegrated through Grafana with proper storage backends and multi-tenancy.",
